        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: La Toya Woods, Ximena Navarrete, Stefanía Fernández\n- Events: Miss Trinidad & Tobago Universe 2010, Miss Universe 2010\n- Places: Las Vegas, USA, Mexico, Venezuela\n\nFacts:\n- La Toya Woods was born in 1985.\n- La Toya Woods won the Miss Trinidad & Tobago Universe 2010 pageant.\n- La Toya Woods was a contestant in the Miss Universe 2010 pageant in Las Vegas, USA.\n- At the end of Miss Universe 2010, Ximena Navarrete of Mexico was crowned by Stefanía Fernández of Venezuela as her successor.",
